WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:15.815
[somber music]

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.905
NEWSCASTER 1: The armed
revolutionary forces

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:15.175
of Colombia known as the
FARC is the most powerful

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.643
guerrilla group in the country.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.746
They control the areas where
large amounts of the world's

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:20.747
cocaine is produced.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.354
NEWSCASTER 2: They are
known as paramilitaries.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.991
They celebrate a legend
of heroic defiance

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.293
against the kidnappers.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.862
Their mission is to achieve
what the army cannot--

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.531
defeat the guerrillas.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:43.169
[somber music]

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:30.536
NEWSCASTER 3: 12 died and
more than 200 passers-by

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:33.239
were injured in this
recent explosion.

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:35.274
Another outrage was to follow.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:37.477
This time, there was no
mistaking the culprit's

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:38.378
identity.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:40.279
That left their
signature at the scene.

00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:51.324
NEWSCASTER 4: Pablo
Escobar couldn't

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:55.194
stay out of the public eye,
and that's what killed him.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:57.163
He died in a hail of
bullets as he tried

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.899
to get away across a roof.

